                        .orElse(null), claim.getDate(), claim.isCorrection());
            };
            if (due != null) {
                total = total.add(due);
            }
        }
        period.close(total);
        audit.change("PERIOD_CLOSED", sheetId, user, "period=" + period.getName(), "total=" + total.toPlainString());
